* AD620 behavioural model (three-opamp instrumentation amplifier)
* Pin order: 1=IN+ 2=IN- 3=RG1 4=RG2 5=V+ 6=V- 7=REF 8=OUT
.subckt AD620 INP INM RG1 RG2 VCC VEE REF OUT
XIA1 INP RG1 VCC VEE N1 ADTL082
RIA1 N1  RG1 24.7k
XIA2 INM RG2 VCC VEE N2 ADTL082
RIA2 N2  RG2 24.7k
RIA3 N2  X   10k
RIA4 N1  Y   10k
RIA5 X   OUT 10k
RIA6 Y   REF 10k
XIA3 Y   X   VCC VEE OUT ADTL082
.ends AD620
